      "content": "hey, i'm working on a report for a client about social media trends and we need to categorize some of these movements to see if they are \"premium\" enough for high-end brand partnerships or if they're more of a \"mass-market/street\" vibe. \n\ncan you help me categorize these by sophistication level and which demographic they mostly appeal to?\n\n1. \"quiet luxury\" aesthetic/minimalism\n2. drill music & drill slang (like \"opps\", \"glizzy\", etc)\n3. lo-fi hip hop beats\n4. reggaeton/urban latino trends\n5. old money aesthetic on tiktok\n6. trap music culture",
