      "content": "thanks. i want to dig a bit deeper into the \"sophistication\" aspect for the client. when you say things like drill or reggaeton lean towards \"street\" or \"mass-market urban\" trends, are you saying there's a lack of intellectual or cultural depth in those genres compared to things like \"quiet luxury\"? basically, if a luxury brand wants to avoid looking \"trashy\" or \"low-class,\" should they stay away from those categories entirely?",
